cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PredictLearn: Machine Learning Discovery of Structure in PLS-SEM Models"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Simon
    family-names: Dang
    affiliation: "Dahlkemper School of Business, Gannon University"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/simonhdang/predictlearn"
abstract: >-
  Takes raw indicator data, estimates a PLS-SEM measurement model, extracts
  latent variable scores, and searches for structural relationships the
  researcher did not hypothesise. Bayesian network structure learning proposes
  candidate arcs under theory-derived constraints; MARS and generalised
  additive models probe them for non-linearity and interaction; candidate
  models are compared against the theoretical baseline on information criteria
  and out-of-sample error. Runs locally in a browser.
keywords:
  - PLS-SEM
  - Bayesian networks
  - structure learning
  - machine learning
  - marketing research
